  "description": "FTIRD.NUMIN stands as a paradigm of modern scientific computing in the .NET ecosystem. \n      Meticulously engineered to parallel the elegance of NumPy, this library \n      seamlessly fuses multidimensional array operations with avant-garde numerical \n      algorithms. It empowers developers to transform raw data into insightful \n      intelligence through an intuitive and high-performance computational toolkit.",
